@startuml codegen-pipeline
title Code Generation Pipeline (`npm run gen`)

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA

start

:Developer edits\n**openapi/openapi.yaml**;
note right
  Single Source of Truth
  - paths (operationId)
  - components/schemas
  - examples
end note

:`npm run gen`\n→ Orval CLI;

:Read **orval.config.ts**;
note right
  - input: ../openapi/openapi.yaml
  - client: 'axios-functions'
  - mode: 'tags-split'
  - mock: { type: 'msw',
           useExamples: true }
  - mutator: { name: 'request' }
end note

:Parse OpenAPI spec;

split

:Generate **TypeScript types**\nsrc/api/models/*.ts;
note right
  Item, ItemCreate
  + barrel index.ts
end note

split again

:Generate **client functions**\nsrc/api/default/default.ts;
note right
  listItems()
  getItem(id)
  createItem(body)
  deleteItem(id)
  ↓ all use request<T>(...)
end note

split again

:Generate **MSW handlers**\nsrc/api/default/default.msw.ts;
note right
  getDefaultMock()
  → returns example arrays
  (when useExamples: true)
end note

end split

:`vue-tsc` で型チェック;

if (型エラー?) then (yes)
  :UI（views）が新仕様を\n使うよう手で修正;
  stop
else (no)
endif

:`npm run dev` または `npm run build`\nで反映確認;

stop

@enduml
